      "side": 1,
      "message": "Before going further with implementation, could you please comment on how this will lead to the NOTICE.html.gz file in the APEX, and how it might integrate with github.com/bazelbuild/rules_license, given that the base Bazel license support is almost non-existent? I think some form of a design doc is necessary, even if it\u0027s scoped to producing NOTICE files for Mainline.\n\nIt would be useful to check-in with aiuto@ on the state of Bazel license rules (https://github.com/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/7444#issuecomment-945906281)\n\nSome reference docs (also on my reading list):\n\n* [License compliance checking with Bazel - PRD](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1-kpfOLNT9nztfD3mtrGL9EX_3DZrGe-PipVyTG4YCGo/edit#heading\u003dh.xiulgbl08end)\n* [Adding OSS license declarations to Bazel](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1XszGbpMYNHk_FGRxKJ9IXW10KxMPdQpF5wWbZFpA4C8/edit)\n* [Design proposal: License Checking with Bazel](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1uwBuhAoBNrw8tmFs-NxlssI6VRolidGYdYqagLqHWt8/edit#)\n",
      "revId": "9ea62e05d9a684a1036c40137009987a3850bcde",
